#: ../../integration_guides/Automation/terraform.rst:180
msgid ""
"Terraform state import is a new feature. At this time, some state file "
"components may break the import process. This feature is being iterated "
"on rapidly to increase coverage to as many application types and "
"conditions as possible."
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Automation/terraform.rst:184
